# SEO page rules

**Site SEO state (what’s already done / don’t redo):** [AGENTS.md — SEO state (as of 2026-11-15)](../../AGENTS.md#seo-state-as-of-2026-11-15).

**Durable SEO + AI Overview rules** (titles ≤60 branded, cannibalization, inbound links, answer-under-H2): [seo.mdc](seo.mdc) · [AGENTS.md §5](../../AGENTS.md#5-seo--aeo--ai-overview-rules) · skill [add-seo-page](../skills/add-seo-page/SKILL.md).

## Research first (before any new or reworked page)

1. One primary query; check autocomplete / PAA / SERP top 5 format.
2. Name intent (do / know / compare / navigate) and match page type.
3. Check `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md` for cannibalization; extend an existing URL when intent overlaps (or merge + 301).
4. List 3–6 secondary questions → H2s and FAQ.
5. Follow [add-seo-page](../skills/add-seo-page/SKILL.md) + `docs/PAGE-CHECKLIST.md`.

## On-page structure

- Title prop ≤48 so branded title ≤60; unique H1 + meta per URL; og/twitter match.
- Exactly one H1; logical H2/H3 (no skipped levels). Phrase H2s as questions when people search that way; put a **1–2 sentence answer under each H2** before detail (AI Overviews / AI Mode).
- Answer first: opening 40–60 words with a **number or clear verdict** in sentence 1 where one exists.
- Include formula + worked example + plain HTML summary tables; visible Reviewed by / last updated + sources; clear link to the matching calculator.
- Tools: calculator inputs ≤60 words after H1 and above the fold on mobile (390×844); cookie bar ≤56px.
- Hubs: 1–2 sentence numeric lead, then **card grid immediately**; also link new children in hub **prose**.
- Guides: answer block immediately after H1; byline/dates after the answer.
- Self-referencing canonical from `siteConfig.siteUrl`; trailing slash; no hardcoded site host; never hard-code tool/guide counts.
- Schema: BreadcrumbList; WebApplication (tools); Article + FAQPage when FAQ is visible; CollectionPage on hubs/indexes.
- **HowTo JSON-LD only from visible on-page steps** (`guideHowTo.ts` / `toolHowTo.ts`). Never invent steps for schema.
- Sitemap `lastmod` from real `dateModified` — never `Date.now()`. Keep `llms.txt` / `llms-full.txt` in sync; do not block AI crawlers in robots.txt.
- Tool pages link ≥1 topical guide high on the page; no thin query-variant duplicates.
